    "blurb": "Read Excel data in Camunda",
    "overview": "Read and extract Excel data directly in your BPMN processes. The Camunda Excel connector supports file access via Document Reference and URL, with five flexible operations including range, sheet, cell address, and coordinate lookups.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Read Excel data directly inside your BPMN processes",
    "splashDescription": "With the Excel connector, your Camunda BPMN processes can read data from Excel files via URL or Camunda Document Reference. It supports five operations: get a table from a range, retrieve file contents, retrieve sheet contents, look up a cell by address, or look up a cell by coordinates. Output is stored in a result variable or mapped via a result expression.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/822035/overview/img6134416531882792272.png?61b9918b6d35a3e1bb394c3d209fbedc",
